          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Rank",
            "Source"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1 (wins)",
              "`run -e`"
            ],
            [
              "2",
              "shell env (pass-through `- KEY`)"
            ],
            [
              "3",
              "`environment:`"
            ],
            [
              "4",
              "`env_file:`"
            ],
            [
              "5 (loses)",
              "Dockerfile `ENV`"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "cloud",
          "title": ".env Is Not env_file",
          "text": "`.env` feeds ==YAML interpolation== only. It does **not** reach containers. Use `env_file:` to inject it."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. env_file Is Not Shell",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "No command substitution like `$(date)`",
            "Quotes parsed by ==Compose's own parser==, not bash",
            "Accepts a list — **later** files win"
          ],
          "style": "cross"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "yaml",
          "lines": [
            "services:",
            "  api:",
            "    env_file:",
            "      - path: ./.env.local",
            "        required: false"
          ],
          "note": "optional files need Compose 2.24+"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Secrets Belong In Files",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "yaml",
          "lines": [
            "secrets:",
            "  db_pw: {file: ./db_pw.txt}",
            "services:",
            "  db:",
            "    secrets: [db_pw]"
          ],
          "note": "lands at /run/secrets/db_pw"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_title": "Secrets, Override Files and Merge Rules",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Never commit real credentials to `.env`",
            "Gitignore it and ship a `.env.example`",
            "`secrets:` mounts files under `/run/secrets/`",
            "Env vars leak into `docker inspect`, `config`, child processes",
            "File-based secrets do not"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Auto-Loaded Files",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`up` loads `compose.yaml` plus `compose.override.yaml` if present",
            "The override merges onto the base",
            "`compose.yaml` is the modern name; `docker-compose.yml` still works",
            "If both exist, `compose.yaml` wins"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "docker compose -f compose.yaml \\",
            "  -f compose.prod.yaml up   # later wins",
            "# COMPOSE_FILE sets it via env",
            "# separator ':' , or ';' on Windows"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "-f Disables Autoload",
          "text": "Once you pass `-f` explicitly, `compose.override.yaml` is no longer picked up. List it yourself."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Merge Rules By Type",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Type",
            "On merge"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "scalars — `image`, `command`",
              "==replaced=="
            ],
            [
              "maps — `environment`, `labels`",
              "merged key-by-key"
            ],
            [
              "lists — `ports`, `dns`",
              "**appended**"
            ],
            [
              "`volumes`, `devices`",
              "merged by target path"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "cloud",
          "title": "Appending Is The Trap",
          "text": "Overriding `ports` adds to the list, so you keep both `8080:80` and `80:80`. Use `!reset` to clear a key or `!override` to replace it (2.24+)."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Sharing Without Full Merges",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`extends:` pulls one service definition from another file",
            "It carries neither `depends_on` nor `volumes_from`",
            "`-f` resolves paths against the **first** file; `extends:` against its own"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`include:` (2.20+) composes whole sub-files into one project",
            "Each included file keeps ==its own project directory==",
            "Default is that file's own dir; `project_directory:` overrides",
            "That path sanity is the **reason** to prefer `include` over `-f`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "# dev = bind mounts + debug ports",
            "# prod = pinned tags, limits, no src",
            "docker compose -f compose.yaml \\",
            "  -f compose.prod.yaml config"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. The Debug Loop",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
              {
